ectly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730513045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3732147240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114806#issuecomment-3732147240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114806","id":3732147240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7edAwo","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T08:22:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T08:26:36Z","body":"I believe the actual fix should be to remove `popup->set_shrink_width(false)` rather than manually calling `popup->set_min_size(Size2(0, 0))`. When `shrink_width` is `true`, `PopupMenu` automatically shrinks its width in `_pre_popup()`. \r\nSo why was `popup->set_shrink_width(false)` added in the first place?(https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114438)\r\n@bruvzg ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"h